      ],
      "source": "https://www.shawlocal.com/daily-journal/news/special-sections/2024/04/27/beecher-has-a-richer-history-than-most-communities/",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "During its 1970 centennial, Beecher adopted the motto “Proud Past, Promising Future,” still seen on some signs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.shawlocal.com/daily-journal/news/special-sections/2024/04/27/beecher-has-a-richer-history-than-most-communities/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Chicago, Vincennes and Danville Railroad ran through Beecher, and its depot now serves as a local history museum open daily.",
